                "Clemmensen & Wolff-Kishner Reduction" to "Clemmensen: >C=O + Zn-Hg/conc HCl ➔ -CH2- | Wolff-Kishner: >C=O + NH2NH2/KOH (in ethylene glycol) ➔ -CH2-",
                "Aldol & Cross-Aldol Condensation" to "Aldol: Aldehydes/Ketones with α-H + dil NaOH ➔ β-hydroxy aldehyde ➔ α,β-unsaturated carbonyl compound",
                "Cannizzaro Reaction" to "Aldehydes with NO α-H + conc. NaOH (50%) ➔ Alcohol + Carboxylate salt (Disproportionation)",
                "HVZ (Hell-Volhard-Zelinsky) Reaction" to "Carboxylic acid with α-H + Red P/X2 ➔ α-halocarboxylic acid",
                "Hoffmann Bromamide Degradation" to "R-CONH2 + Br2 + 4 KOH ➔ R-NH2 + K2CO3 + 2 KBr + 2 H2O (Prepares 1° amine with 1 less C)",
                "Gabriel Phthalimide Synthesis" to "Phthalimide + KOH + R-X + N2H4 ➔ 1° aliphatic amine (Cannot prepare aromatic amines)",
                "Carbylamine Test (Isocyanide Test)" to "1° Amine + CHCl3 + 3 KOH (alc.) ➔ R-NC (Foul smelling Isocyanide) [Test for 1° amine]",
                "Sandmeyer & Gattermann Reaction" to "Sandmeyer: Ar-N2+Cl- + Cu2X2/HX ➔ Ar-X | Gattermann: Ar-N2+Cl- + Cu powder/HX ➔ Ar-X",
                "Ideal Gas & Ideal Solutions (Raoult's Law)" to "PV = nRT | P_total = P°_A X_A + P°_B X_B (Ideal: ΔH_mix=0, ΔV_mix=0)",
                "Molarity, Molality & Mole Fraction" to "M = Moles/Vol(L) | m = Moles/Mass of solvent(kg) | X_A = n_A / (n_A + n_B)",
                "Nernst Equation for Electrode Potential" to "E = E° - (0.0591/n) log10([Products]/[Reactants]) at 298 K",
                "First Order Reaction Rate Law & Half Life" to "k = (2.303/t) log10([A]_0 / [A]) | t_1/2 = 0.693 / k"
            )
        )
    )
}
